.TH MX-LOCALE 1 "2026-07-20" "MX Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-locale \- manage system locale settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-locale
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mx-locale
provides a graphical interface for choosing the system-wide default language, setting locale subvariables, and managing compiled locale caches. It can also remove locales other than the current system locale.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -l , " " --only-lang
Show only the language-selection tab.
.TP
.BR -f , " " --full-categories
Show all locale categories.
.TP
.BR -h , " " --help
Show help for the command.
.TP
.BR -v , " " --version
Show the application version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/mx-locale
Installed HTML help, images, license, and changelog documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR locale (1),
.BR locale-gen (8)
.SH AUTHOR
MX Linux contributors.
